     3.2 Handover Root Cause Analysis

     Business Question: "Why are tickets being handed over to humans?"
     Why Unique: Diagnoses the problem, not just reports the symptom

     -- Analyze which intents drive the most handovers (proxy from CSAT patterns)
     -- Lower CSAT on all_ai_agent vs fully_resolved suggests handover friction
     SELECT
       c.month,
       c.csat_ai_agent_fully_resolved as csat_when_ai_handles,
       c.csat_all_ai_agent as csat_including_handovers,
       ROUND(c.csat_ai_agent_fully_resolved - c.csat_all_ai_agent, 2) as handover_csat_penalty,
       c.count_ai_agent_fully_resolved as fully_resolved_count,
       c.count_all_ai_agent - c.count_ai_agent_fully_resolved as handover_count,
       ROUND((c.count_all_ai_agent - c.count_ai_agent_fully_resolved) * 1.0 / c.count_all_ai_agent * 100, 1) as handover_rate
     FROM `growth-ops-recruiting.growth_marketing_recruiting.CSATbyInteractionType` c
     ORDER BY c.month

