     EXECUTIVE SUMMARY DASHBOARD

     Key Metrics (Unique to Our Dashboard)

     | Metric   | What Periscope Shows | What We Show            |
     |----------|----------------------|-------------------------|
     | Tickets  | Volume count         | Savings from automation |
     | CSAT     | Score by type        | CSAT risk alerts        |
     | Handover | Rate percentage      | Cost of handovers       |
